[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:The Weekend]
[00:00.88]Lesson 67 | 第67课
[00:02.76]The weekend | 周末
[00:04.97]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:10.34]What are the Johnsons going to do at the weekend? | 约翰逊一家周末打算做什么？
[00:16.63]Hello. Were you at the butcher's? | 你好。你刚才在肉店吗？
[00:21.55]Yes, I was. | 是的，我在那里。
[00:23.64]Were you at the butcher's, too? | 你也在肉店吗？
[00:27.22]No, I wasn't. | 不，我不在。
[00:30.15]I was at the greengrocer's. | 我在蔬菜店。
[00:33.73]How's Jimmy today? | 吉米今天怎么样？
[00:36.40]He's very well, thank you. | 他很好，谢谢你。
[00:40.35]Was he absent from school last week? | 他上周没去上学吗？
[00:45.32]Yes, he was. | 是的，他没去。
[00:47.64]He was absent on Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday and Thursday. | 他周一、周二、周三和周四都没去。
[00:55.57]How are you all keeping? | 你们都好吗？
[00:58.88]Very well, thank you. | 我们都很好，谢谢。
[01:02.03]We're going to spend three days in the country! | 我们要去乡下待三天！
[01:06.76]We're going to stay at my mother's for the weekend. | 这个周末我们要待在我妈妈家。
[01:12.74]Friday, Saturday and Sunday in the country! | 周五、周六和周日在乡下！
[01:18.78]Aren't you lucky! | 你们真幸运！